2026-11-19T17:38:12.0090310Z     python3 tools/audit/seat/features_block.py [--prelude 'import line']... --through "<marker line>"
2026-11-19T17:38:12.0091093Z     python3 tools/audit/seat/features_block.py --emit-prelude OUT "<first line of the block>" [END]
